# Networking

- Recommend people, draft messages, schedule follow-ups — never auto-send.
- Prefer alumni/team relevance over seniority.
- First ask is usually perspective, not referral.
- Caps: 2–3 first outreach, 1–2 follow-ups, ≤1 referral ask/day.
- Do not re-contact the same person within 7 days.
